title: let user promote and demote a node in another's backlinks
pid: 4ceee3e4-b6da-4611-93fc-1c551c4f6fa7
body: |2-
    Whichever means explicitly labeling fewer link sources.
    e.g. relationship nodes like 'instances'
    should promote a few nodes that are actually about the node
    'instances'
    vs. a lot that use it as a relationship label
